The model. pito-embed ships no model weights. src/catalog.rs names the six
files of EmbeddingGemma-300m in ONNX form, q4 quantised, as published by
onnx-community at
https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/embeddinggemma-300m-ONNX, pinned to
commit 5090578d9565bb06545b4552f76e6bc2c93e4a66 with each file's sha256.
EmbeddingGemma is Google's model and is provided under and subject to the
Gemma Terms of Use at https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms, with the Gemma
Prohibited Use Policy at https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy.
Whoever downloads and uses the model accepts those terms; they are not
covered by the MIT licence.

The terminal clips docs/images/search.gif, docs/images/bench.gif and
docs/images/machine.gif were recorded by prec from this repository's own
shots (render/terminal.toml and the tapes in render/terminal/) running
examples/search.rs, examples/bench.rs and examples/machine.rs, and made GIFs
by pcod (pito-codecs). The chart docs/images/speed-paired.png was drawn by pito-compare
from docs/bench/speed.toml, the numbers of one run of examples/bench.rs. They
are under the MIT licence like the code.

